# Decode14 (2026-10-14): the cuMem* virtual-memory API on top of tinygrad's NV memory manager
# (cuMemAddressReserve/Create/Map/SetAccess/Unmap/Release, granularity 2 MiB, cuDeviceGetAttribute VMM) so Strata's
# elastic K/V (--kv-grow, strata patch 0018) works: Context.vmm_* with a batched PTE writer (600 chunks map in 17.5 ms),
# mem_info counts the VMM chunks; tgcudart.cpp: the driver-API entry points (TGCU_VMM=0 hides them).
# Base: patches/shim/base/ (the host-tail shim, git 25ae464) + the earlier shim patches; `git apply -p1` in a directory that holds shim/<file>.

